%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6170d1c959a2065d6b794816b2a5ef88, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Charl01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseClosed.Data.DialogueTreeSO
  treeId: TREE_CHARL_01
  characterId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
  startNodeId: NODE_01
  nodes:
  - nodeId: NODE_01
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 10
    statementText: I was standing right outside the office door when I heard the
      window shatter from the alley at 11:00 PM.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01B_PAUL_DEFENDS
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01B_PAUL_DEFENDS
    speakerId: CHAR_PAUL_CAMACHO
    speakerName: Paul Gabriel Camacho
    expression: 10
    statementText: Officer Pascual has guarded my gallery for three years, Detective.
      A street thief broke through that back alley window to steal my prize painting!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01C_DETECTIVE_INTERVIEW
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01C_DETECTIVE_INTERVIEW
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: Mr. Camacho, you claim you were at home when the alarm rang. Let
      the guard speak. Charl, describe exactly what you saw around that window.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02_WINDOW_LEAD
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02_WINDOW_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 10
    statementText: The alley window was broken from outside. Check the crime scene
      photo of the window frame if you doubt me.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02B_PAUL_DIVERT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_SHIFT_LOG
  - nodeId: NODE_02B_PAUL_DIVERT
    speakerId: CHAR_PAUL_CAMACHO
    speakerName: Paul Gabriel Camacho
    expression: 6
    statementText: Don't waste time harassing my staff, Detective! We should be tracking
      the black market, not inspecting window glass!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_PHOTO
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_PHOTO
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: We follow the physical evidence. The window frame photo and the
      guard's keycard shift log will reveal who was present at 11:00 PM.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03_SHIFT_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 2
    statementText: The shift log is routine. It will show I was near the office,
      exactly as I said.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03B_CONFIRMATION
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_INSURANCE_POLICY
  - nodeId: NODE_03B_CONFIRMATION
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: The crime scene photo shows glass shards scattered OUTSIDE into
      the alley. That window was smashed from INSIDE the gallery. Why does your story
      place you outside?
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03C_PAUL_DEFENSIVE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03C_PAUL_DEFENSIVE
    speakerId: CHAR_PAUL_CAMACHO
    speakerName: Paul Gabriel Camacho
    expression: 6
    statementText: Broken from inside?! That's preposterous! What reason would anyone
      here have to damage my own gallery?!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03D_DETECTIVE_POLICY
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03D_DETECTIVE_POLICY
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: 'A half-million dollar insurance policy rider stamped two days
      ago might answer that question, Mr. Camacho. Charl, one final chance: where
      were you?'
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_STATEMENT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_STATEMENT
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 10
    statementText: I was outside that office at 11:00 PM. The keycard record cannot
      say otherwise.
    isChallengeable: 1
    targetContradictionRuleId: RULE_CHARL_LOCATION_LIE
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05_CONFESSION
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 2
    statementText: Fine! The shift log doesn't lie. I was at the East Gate. Mr. Paul
      Camacho paid me 2,000 credits to stage the break-in from inside!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05B_PAUL_OUTRAGED
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05B_PAUL_OUTRAGED
    speakerId: CHAR_PAUL_CAMACHO
    speakerName: Paul Gabriel Camacho
    expression: 3
    statementText: You incompetent fool, Pascual! Shut your mouth! Detective, he's
      fabricating lies to cover for his own negligence!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05C_CHARL_EVIDENCE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05C_CHARL_EVIDENCE
    speakerId: CHAR_CHARL_PASCUAL
    speakerName: Charl Vonn Pascual
    expression: 6
    statementText: I kept your encrypted wire transfer receipt, Paul! You told me
      you needed the 500,000 insurance payout to save the gallery from bankruptcy!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: Glass on the alley cobblestones, a fraudulent shift alibi, and
      a doubled insurance policy. Paul Camacho and Charl Pascual, you are both under
      arrest for conspiracy and insurance fraud.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
